         text="A plain stepped platform is built against the front of the Feathered Serpent Pyramid, hiding its carved heads; elsewhere sculptures are torn down and the temple on top destroyed. Many read this as a political upheaval, perhaps a turn from rule by one lord to a more collective government.",
