         text="Temples and palaces along the Avenue of the Dead are set on fire, their sculptures smashed and scattered; ordinary compounds are mostly spared. The targets suggest an uprising against the city's rulers rather than an invasion, perhaps after years of drought and hardship. The centre was never rebuilt.",
